OL,3,CProgramme listings for
OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 30 NOV
OL,4,G1600FIggy Pop
OL,5,     GIggy serves up a sonic cocktail
OL,6,     Gto soundtrack your Sunday
OL,7,     Gafternoon. This weekend, he's
OL,8,     Gspinning tunes by The Doors,
OL,9,     GMogwai, Yasmine Hamdan, Zaho de
OL,10,     GSagazan and Fats Waller.
OL,11,G1800FMary Anne Hobbs
OL,12,     GWith a borderless spectrum of
OL,13,     Gmusic, new experiments in
OL,14,     GStorytelling and sound.
OL,15,G2000FStuart Maconie's Freak Zone
OL,16,     GStuart's featured album is Brian
OL,17,     GEno's transitional 1975 classic
OL,18,     G'Another Green World', in this
OL,19,     Gweek's showcase of experimental
OL,20,     Gand avant-garde music.
